Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — Xorg driver
 The nvidia_drv.so X.Org video driver from the 390.157 release.
 Officially targets X server video driver ABI <= 25.


Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 libgl1, libglx0, libegl1, libgbm1,
Provides:
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd,
 libgl1-nvidia-glx,
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-390xx-glx,
 vdpau-driver,
 libglx-nvidia,
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — runtime libraries
 Every shared library from the NVIDIA 390.157 userspace: libGL / libGLX_nvidia
 / libEGL_nvidia, libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore,
 libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends, plus the GLX X extension module. Install the
 :i386 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 390.157 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-5.4.0-216-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-5.4.0-216-generic
Provides: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-5.4.0-216-generic,
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390xx prebuilt module for Linux 5.4.0-216-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 390xx series,
 compiled for the 5.4.0-216-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
